# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env.platforms — audierne2026
# Concern: platform tokens (GitHub). Blast radius: platform breach.
# Rotation: seasonal, at expiry, or on exposure.
# Load with: source scripts/dev-env.sh
# CI does not read this file: Actions reads its own repository secrets.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Ocapistaine bot — cross-repo RAG handoff to locki-io/ocapistaine (dev branch
# only, never main). The same name is the Actions secret of feed_mistral_rag.yml.
OCAPISTAINE_GITHUB_TOKEN=<forseti - ok>

# Project management on audierne2026/participons, for scripts run by hand
# (export, consolidate, synthesis, poll). In CI the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN serves.
AUDIERNE_GITHUB_PAT_TOKEN=<forseti - ok>
